# is in play X = 2 pays {2}{W}{W} out of five mana, one {G} left over. Two white Ally tokens are made and, since the tokens come
# first (CR 608.2c), they get a counter too: 2/2 each, Bot1's Ornithopter 1/3, and Bot2's Ornithopter stays 0/2 ("you control").

